  {
   "id": "pro-cycling-manager-2023-241245@3",
   "gameId": "pro-cycling-manager-2023-241245",
   "displayName": "Patch 3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-07-31T14:00:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cyclist friends and bike fans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update is available for PCM.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Race",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Soften physical attributes effects (Stamina, Resistance): they act a little later on the green energy bar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjust Recovery & Freshness for stage races: a bit more green energy for a given freshness, and a bit less difference between riders for recovery between two stages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix energy “exploit” during long climbs (alternation Effort cursor 95/30% to empty then fill the red energy). A low effort means now a smaller power and thus cancel exploit’s effect.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pro Cyclist",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Objectives: races during targets give a bonus to “race-day condition”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Objectives: fix the bug which displayed objectives for Pro Cyclist (footer and Riders page)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improve progression of Stamina and Resistance attributes. To make the most of these settings, you have to start a new game (on an existing game, the improvements are present but less marked).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Career",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug “I can't choose a trainer for U23 runners”: the component has been removed (intented behavior). There is no penalty of riders’progression from U23 teams.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the win count bug for towers in the Archives page.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug when the player had no U23 team, the other U23 teams did poor recruitment (sometimes only 3-5 riders)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Multiplayer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug displaying the race name in the calendar (variable instead of the race’s name).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Addition of the “Medium Mountain” attribute in the “Start list” page",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed display of sponsor objectives icon instead of rider’s objectives icon in the Calendar page.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update Jerseys / Database",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hotfix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that prevented proper recruitment of U23 teams when the player did not have a U23 team of his own.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
