  {
   "id": "pro-cycling-manager-2023-241245@major-2023-06-29",
   "gameId": "pro-cycling-manager-2023-241245",
   "displayName": "New update is coming!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-29T15:31:20.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Cyclist friends and bike fans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new update is available for PCM. You can read the most important points below, or read the full changelog.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Most important points",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "👉Important sprint train improvements: teams organize themselves better according to their resources.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉Fixed too easy sprints in mountain finish with AIs starting too late without properly using their energy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉Fixed issues with disconnection/game crashes when the server was unstable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉Fixed the crash in multiplayer games that happened within the rankings page during a race.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉Fixed the shift that appears from season 2 Pro Cyclist between calendar and rider’s fitness.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👉Added functionality to create typical training weeks for Pro Cyclist blocks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Race",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Important sprint train improvements: teams organize themselves better according to their resources.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed too easy sprints in mountain finish with AIs starting too late without properly using their energy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sprinters start sprints a little earlier and with a little more variation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that caused riders wanting to catch up to a leader to not apply high enough power on a climb.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed racing map interface bug in 2560x1440 resolution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the bug of custom comments from riders never being played.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Team time-trial: The display of times in the team rankings was not correct and did not correspond to the sum of the individual times.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Multiplayer",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed issues with disconnection/game crashes when the server was unstable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the crash in multiplayer games that happened within the rankings page during a race.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added player names (with specific color) into rankings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bugs that prevented the ladder from being functional.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Pro Cyclist",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed the shift that appears from season 2 Pro Cyclist between calendar and rider’s fitness.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added functionality to create typical training weeks for Pro Cyclist blocks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed wins in the Achievements tile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Career",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "AI Roster improvements for leaders to participate more in the Dauphiné and Tour d'Helvétie in June.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
