       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug that caused sprinters to often participate in Medium Mountain Classics (Gran Premio San Sebastian, GP di Lombardia). Fix only valid on new games AND if the mods also fix the problem on their side.",
